Topology: 1 Wireless Router + 2 PCs

Step 1: Add Devices

Drag and place:

1 × Wireless Router
2 × PCs
Step 2: Configure Wireless Router
1. Open Router
Double-click the Wireless Router
2. Disable DHCP
Click GUI tab
Default IP Address:
192.168.0.1
Locate DHCP Server
Select Disable
Click Save Settings
3. Configure Wireless Network Name (SSID)
Click Wireless
Wireless Network Name (SSID):
MY Network
Click Save Settings
4. Configure Wireless Security
Click Wireless Security
Security Mode:
WEP
Create 10-digit password:
1234567890
Click Save Settings

Router configuration is now complete.

Step 3: Configure PC1 Wireless Adapter
1. Open PC1
Double-click PC1
2. Power Off PC
Click Physical
Turn power switch OFF
3. Replace Network Card
Remove existing FastEthernet card
Insert WMP300N Wireless Adapter
4. Power On PC
Turn power switch ON
5. Connect to Wireless Network
Go to Desktop
Click PC Wireless
Click Connect

Select:

SSID: MY Network

Password:

1234567890

Click:

Connect
Step 4: Configure Static IP on PC1

Since DHCP is disabled, manually assign IP.

Go to:

Desktop → IP Configuration

Configure:

Setting	Value
IP Address	192.168.0.2
Subnet Mask	255.255.255.0
Default Gateway	192.168.0.1

Close window.

Step 5: Configure PC2 Wireless Adapter
1. Open PC2
Double-click PC2
2. Power Off PC
Click Physical
Turn power switch OFF
3. Replace Network Card
Remove FastEthernet card
Insert WMP300N Wireless Adapter
4. Power On PC
Turn power switch ON
5. Connect to Wireless Network

Go to:

Desktop → PC Wireless

Click:

Connect

Select:

SSID: MY Network

Enter password:

1234567890

Click:

Connect
Step 6: Configure Static IP on PC2

Go to:

Desktop → IP Configuration

Configure:

Setting	Value
IP Address	192.168.0.3
Subnet Mask	255.255.255.0
Default Gateway	192.168.0.1
Step 7: Verify Connectivity
From PC1

Desktop → Command Prompt

Plain Text
ping 192.168.0.3

Expected:

Plain Text
Reply from 192.168.0.3
From PC2

Desktop → Command Prompt

Plain Text
ping 192.168.0.2

Expected:

Plain Text
Reply from 192.168.0.2
IP Addressing Summary
Device	IP Address	Subnet Mask	Gateway
Wireless Router	192.168.0.1	255.255.255.0	N/A
PC1	192.168.0.2	255.255.255.0	192.168.0.1
PC2	192.168.0.3	255.255.255.0	192.168.0.1
